<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.27%			C/S =  8.27%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.54%			O/N =  9.33%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27%			T/N =  5.09%</p>
<p>		   Feb  3, 1997			Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  4.75%	1 month forward =  4.07%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.11%	2 month forward =  5.43%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.79%	3 month forward =  6.44%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.87%	4 month forward =  6.70%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.19%	5 month forward =  7.05%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.36%	6 month forward =  7.19%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
